    "description": "Are you a skilled Senior Property Advisor looking for your next big career move? Mindspace Business Parks REIT Advisory Limited in Agra offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Mindspace Business Parks REIT Advisory Limited:\nMindspace Business Parks REIT Advisory Limited is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with architects, contractors, and project teams\n• Achieve monthly and quarterly sales targets\n• Negotiate pricing, terms, and conditions on behalf of clients\n• Provide advisory services on property investment and market trends\n• Conduct site visits and property presentations for clients\n• Conduct market research and provide competitive analysis\n• Liaise with banks and NBFCs for home loan assistance to customers\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Client Relationship Management\n• Proficiency in Title Search\n• Proficiency in Financial Modeling\n• Proficiency in Real Estate Law\n• Proficiency in GIS Tools\n• Proficiency in Market Research\n• Proficiency in AutoCAD\n• Proficiency in Investment Analysis\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Agra, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Mindspace Business Parks REIT Advisory Limited!",
